msgid "Inject <0>createSecureStoreAdapter</0> and "
"<1>createExpoWebBrowserAdapter</1> into <2>XidProvider</2>. No top-level "
"Expo module import is needed; adapters accept module instances so CI "
"typecheck stays clean without Expo peer deps installed."
msgstr "<2>XidProvider</2>에 <0>createSecureStoreAdapter</0>와 "
"<1>createExpoWebBrowserAdapter</1>를 주입하세요. 최상위 Expo 모듈 가져오기가 필요하지 않습니다. "
"어댑터는 모듈 인스턴스를 허용하므로 Expo 피어 의존성 설치 없이도 CI 타입 검사가 깔끔하게 유지됩니다."

#: apps/server/src/routes/docs/sdk-docs/react-native.tsx
msgid "Inject a <0>TokenCache</0> (platform secure storage) and a "
"<1>BrowserInterface</1> (in-app browser) into <2>XidProvider</2>. The "
"SDK does not hard-bind any native module; Expo apps can use the "
"ready-made adapters from <3>@xid-kit/expo</3>."
